</figure>
<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE II: </span>Different mappings description.</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
