<th id="S5.T2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">AttAcc1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite></th>
<td id="S5.T2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S5.T2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:224.3pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Prefill phase on CiM (128 wordlines turned ON for 128x128 crossbar) and Attention layer during decode phase on CiD</span>
</span></td></tr>
